{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ade874004a89fed7949507efee0fe64dc8a1fc60049d5ab7499b089ea4586ebf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0250252de60e2f846b933ec76c3134b43e093e2510349df59f99616f9a67cae6",
      "text": "3个人一起，目标是世界和平！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5519306de07485053a3c7cd30b1413fa8f741e15cff0e5e088faa3513664bb81",
      "text": "实与皮埃尔来到了正在打工的恭二身边。\n他们表示，为了促进商店街商会的交流，\n希望能让他填写个人资料卡。\n看到皮埃尔在将来的梦想一栏写上“世界和平”，\n恭二的表情莫名有些僵硬……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0250252de60e2f846b933ec76c3134b43e093e2510349df59f99616f9a67cae6",
      "text": "3个人一起，目标是世界和平！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dca0392d1ed7ba0763b5ae3d92dd782e877dfdea241451c9c28020c794d8233",
      "text": "那我去休息了……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d046979828a96c19286e3ecc76b56c659d0f3a762fa6084e4ee94a722ae3a672",
      "text": "恭二～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac62ceaca2cc7e27a1c806dca21557a668c345c0e455692dedb8bb10914f5da0",
      "text": "哟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ac2384d4a2c4a6c27ea90664a8ef0e21b47ce8993b35470b86b558013ec07c4",
      "text": "你们两个，看起来不像是来吃午饭的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cccbfcc00cea3dc5b5d23f9e6685c6df40b8e3c00be5a4bf6593927e01b954",
      "text": "呵呵，感觉挺敏锐的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04cf84fd1e19811b586ea10fa9dd5928de57c5ed1e3b3eec8f03a0e135c3279c",
      "text": "恭二，帮我写这个！拜托了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfa363f41cbe99c94a733f5397af4716676ea33e3d8272df9d5e6ffd1249e62",
      "text": "……卡片？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56cd2473a9e30bb473d6286e97eb3656fd662325e282e4c7cc67c0dcb8ee916",
      "text": "是个人资料卡啦。我们3人打工的\n那条商店街的管理商会拜托我们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b10b00ea07c2e6dba7adf0e0a158972f080268fe48a81215fcf30a6636c18be0",
      "text": "说是为了搞活商会成员之间的交流，\n希望大家都能写一份。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b8074effef6b1daf3547e87ba96b4d8c38ebedde7f2e0df92a768657f861b27",
      "text": "……要填的栏位还挺多的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a552720f83e4c528ad5b650cfafebd52b8bd3b5f3568ab4d6ef0c4820de246f",
      "text": "真是的，别露出那么嫌麻烦的表情嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3f2f2b35ae60eaaace4d0e11e2b3d3a99d28fa4aa21949e5d287efb00b17302",
      "text": "个人资料的栏目有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d0bfe322dd1600f3d0a6516f2fc2b25c75c45c02c2ce3b2b3a489627af9d0cc",
      "text": "姓名、出生年月日、兴趣、特长、喜欢的事物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5e432382bfd3e8fad5360bef000dd0ce9d60b8c9c0bdb03d2f2c3aef2c6ce6d",
      "text": "我喜欢青蛙！喜欢面食！\n实也喜欢，恭二也喜欢，大家最喜欢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33213d3fb0e50f696753d84c0acd62c3d8c9f1b447d39459879c546e6e9f2a96",
      "text": "可是，写的地方，好小。\n好烦恼……你看，实，恭二！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eb80404f40970464f69e93801a6f9e06ce3a1109301b9c65c10931284ace580",
      "text": "哇，皮埃尔，全都是用日语写的啊。\n写得非常棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7224b95d091f17486dba5310b46cd3b178e6b5780b8a60eb09791c54e9d8d46",
      "text": "嘿嘿，谢谢！\n实写了什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae3f3e5d8bd84fa7d10f379db96e93c89ecd0fcbeef2000080174a5172b46bb0",
      "text": "喜欢的东西是“偶像”！\n要是附近也有喜欢偶像的同好，那就太高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c65f114d62213563a2109e7f20e1ced2fe1fd1d4b9aadec50efc19489847ef39",
      "text": "偶像啊……说起来，你之前也提过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f8d60e5d00a3b3b395202f9037dc73163bdbdd293c489e4dee620e7f034b669",
      "text": "还有，最后一栏是……将来的梦想……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d4ce0ed44b5b7250efc2b8f5a6faa97f30a3a94eadb1e78a11f77b1df6d5618",
      "text": "我的梦想是，世界和平！\n让大家，露出笑容！让大家，幸福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d33e8c67ce3f92abd44a558a5d380a7b43cd5b3e22f113c9bd12855150eb70e",
      "text": "恭二，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b10bb4d36d8ebde68965908ecf13f5ea2419c1b9df740b3bbb4304490e2d0b9d",
      "text": "没……\n只是觉得，好久没听到“世界和平”这种词了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e5313bf19f4613efc47cb3bedd358db5087acc3a2372fe080c6ff7d210ebccb",
      "text": "（世界和平吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2354f3964a5c36b9c7036bed21a12214d5137ab97458c6edf130063e7043913",
      "text": "鹰城大宅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79856bf1ea66506ec4af2c872edeae922d179ad88583b55a122abc686fb9d6ef",
      "text": "“目标是世界和平”？\n哈，你突然胡扯些什么啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c89b7369f30b1c0622988f518ebc83333c795a94228f8fd078c3ae3ab03d4c8a",
      "text": "我是认真的。\n为了这个……我要继承鹰城家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eff3c83bb070578e5f0a1c7306f5bfa580f0d9b713d9ece414a6c03538597499",
      "text": "原来如此，这才是你的真心话吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2daebe6608f683e92ee837d07fd88a3a4a9e2cb7d97f8b1061ce0ae139ad849d",
      "text": "毕竟如果只说“因为我是长子所以继承家业”，\n听上去不够体面嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6aa9637ab5576e32406785db5f85eaee11b91964b821b2edde6c920d2271c38",
      "text": "所以才把“世界和平”这种\n夸张的大话挂在嘴边，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdef86c633b20c0d68276b33ecd01fbdaf1e051411969c707f2aa4b6518bed5c",
      "text": "……像你这种半吊子，\n大概还无法理解吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1583bf153706534f6904f852ebdae0952256bce60b5d30def77561711203afd4",
      "text": "半吊子……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd6f871d11ddc5f876e2828d60fb56cc0f40d14246e4bba689abdef946327a6e",
      "text": "既不肯走铺好的轨道，\n却也没有自己的梦想和目标……对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67cf3a0567673549c4eb64f9a9487c394d36318bd8bb934d59efc2dead3d7ef4",
      "text": "唔……大哥你才是，不就只是顺着\n这个家铺好的轨道随波逐流吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e06fe1db1c117ef7f6cb7aac66c9434f3a130bd1f75cebb9f8d9afce4f8585",
      "text": "我才不一样！我和大哥……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad895184469f07bb6a597956377363faae0f193c8c50424aecc0e16bdc55e19",
      "text": "听说你要离开这个家了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0edc00bee8e02dfd435f390c8a821dc5f3a325f4176e1654b9c6003206801f69",
      "text": "和大哥你没关系吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ca7e5ceaf0ee7c2895ab691e8acb114889e28b85a515c75754c6d0fbe593c7c",
      "text": "考大学的事，还有和老头子的事，我都听说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9456e1bfccce4212c7107834d7480a1a2dfc50d8c749f3e103648d1ae90be3fd",
      "text": "所以，大哥也是来骂我的吗？\n说什么“鹰城家的耻辱，整个家族的败类”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e643c7cbb2f6272d620a63b59428725fce058f02d36ce4c9849bb9fdf7573a",
      "text": "……你就甘愿一直被贴着\n那样的标签吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d906bb765107b00038390e2342c595a5f9e6ab99ede6e0eb5ea56e2685769a8",
      "text": "像这样逃走的话，\n到头来不过是个丧家之犬罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f44e7020fa37f7c4552790094bb31ab3e662446bf35e41854fe00ca1cc8ba0",
      "text": "……我才不会当什么丧家之犬！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aace0f109736f120d3511a931d14f2f5c5543df3757918c7b3fa27c8d67f86c",
      "text": "我和你不一样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34efd6db3394332a9ffe3bcc828568ea037d78b1b3d20fcb35b3e6b6ba0cd871",
      "text": "就算没有鹰城的名字，我也一样会成功给你看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ef2035a62cba5b57bfdf52d08e01e0b1309fef37e4b1d271563bf77fe9439d4",
      "text": "啊，打工的时间到了！\n我得走了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf2fd883fc54d4bf9f818091a41309deb4f761a63d7e6a11a9a313fb0ecb635b",
      "text": "恭二，实，回头见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84a280419a5122cc0423a220cdca7705901ca6ecb164309cbf444c939d101506",
      "text": "啊、啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22bb66eec55cd8ad94d8cbde488a65883328b2c95379fe7467a1a8b2925ea707",
      "text": "从刚才起就一直在发呆，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78ff8cfa1c9202103714cac9f11e62c28014883631c21318633903653f98ab37",
      "text": "没……只是觉得把梦想定为世界和平，15岁还真是天真烂漫啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f447a96379cefe60ed790a706439a8a8a42d2848ea323f7dc47c543914f3d4c8",
      "text": "皮埃尔尤其如此呢。\n因为他无论何时都那么率真。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d32b8c89a0922ad7c03f09cd70f139ec34fc0ad3dde735a89976e749676f9353",
      "text": "……话说回来，虽然你语气听起来像个大人，\n但恭二你也才二十岁吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:576944c8777cf112572cef13c8a737617d8701b3be528e33d15ac9df2da3a240",
      "text": "将来的梦想啦，想做的事情啦，\n应该有很多才对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3de8c9629bcd4886ab50d231412a912eb4d32d67c8e17063851295e12e9abf00",
      "text": "……是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a99de41a4660956ea2c5662b226dceace11307f7c8f46e487ec675bb0a0034",
      "text": "我也差不多该回岗位上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cae629b61d6048570712ce61e6bb3ddee0481356a05fb2c87254685bc7fc66f4",
      "text": "OK！那在下次来之前，\n要把个人资料卡填好哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a641b7db95e069820cee1141a157e3f5e598505f59c69b420f38fc180e23b50",
      "text": "恭二的公寓",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5edd616e93b366a09d54eea37e74d3a4055e00118be8d79e02ca19bfb1031987",
      "text": "将来的梦想，吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b830b7d3047aff36d6ad7dbdba5b693b95b8fdf19b749f22ba215a1f559fab65",
      "text": "（如果是梦想的话，感觉已经实现了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85482bc598ac29c951172b5749f5c920d4cde8b1c888af924be7d9b48d18e6e8",
      "text": "（现在的我，不依靠那个家，\n自己挣钱，一个人生活）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26ae1958ef4bfd4c2b93288971fca144aa65ab99945b93ad18e3908c69178a4c",
      "text": "（在此之上，并没有什么特别奢求的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01818f17d02c269e2bc1fb42e0b9e1222cc1b61ae7b6edba96ddca2edf37165c",
      "text": "把信箱里的传单整理一下吧。\n……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d0ffbcbfd60db8c80e099f220a8b663c26f4fa37a3395dd361060263eac9cd",
      "text": "“关于房地产，请找行业巨头鹰城不动产。\n为您找到理想的住所”……哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebb10a5a1ed62dc907c4efa00326de09897793b2341adf359fec6a687f5c9bbb",
      "text": "就算信箱上的姓氏一样，\n任谁也不会觉得我和这家公司是一家人吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2dcd59f2c69d512ba30e8901967be758a3a12030abee036fb057da94a8fa141",
      "text": "（我只要就这样靠自己的力量，\n过好自己的人生，那就足够了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e1d0e55ee77048ed233ec55ea74fd85bd04955f3314ac30d3278a0ae1a51fe",
      "text": "对了，个人资料卡。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1605c3e8daf8337ee09a4c9271b136b956372fd3afb89df1d2d354e4e1f738d0",
      "text": "……鹰城恭二，生日是2月2日。\n兴趣的话，嗯……洗衣服吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2da533b2e2472fdf187299127d06f10c7c9f47795b3b28093bc9b3837550b335",
      "text": "将来的梦想是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f253a01b31441ad12da314a0dedd2f44a92db39dd496992fd986703fe9f15465",
      "text": "梦想……暂无。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99c137dec5e463b0ec7f8769d53822b74d4874ddbc6dc35ca999870736d308eb",
      "text": "便利店楼顶",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771c1def704ebb41261fe1fe0a44689064fbf2fc937f2d241bedebe4088e183a",
      "text": "哈？我们当偶像……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:546500ca6548b1eee96e0e9051cd9d84b98f071d849494d724ccd79fcf8a614c",
      "text": "嗯！实也一起！\n大家一起当偶像吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52658974c10944348b00186a229c887f2b499b2cbb1a8d2e5b449639fed430a1",
      "text": "我还以为你们是来收个人资料卡的，\n怎么突然扯到这个上了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa1196a93f84b5f58737c400fdc613bbaaf6464bdd66d8665d10be82a2c4b5ca",
      "text": "……实先生，你对皮埃尔说了什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa751f2d57c9487ef94cfb3b7a9123c06e8452aeea280819f413c12dff4a53dc",
      "text": "哎呀，别用那种眼神看我嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7108b41d0442fa15a0c3459659b8c6ab01d58bd7cad676710b6a0c0eecb709",
      "text": "实告诉我了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:572fe7ad4aebe420ba1b209167aed77e22e07bcec15c0e12d7a7915684a8332f",
      "text": "偶像能让大家都笑起来！\n只要大家都笑起来，就能实现世界和平！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa6eeb2b7b977cbd21d3168639d95db4f7188bab4a77b026f6b8a80363d3a8c7",
      "text": "所以，当了偶像，就能世界和平！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8db620d6564c308c06b920d86ad3f14db242ebcdc0f93811d54a094e29e417f",
      "text": "……还真是异想天开啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6760f4ecdcd517305555d3e97571ab3d7c884c529df4a0493020c235f211657",
      "text": "呵呵，也许吧。……不过，\n偶像拥有能让男女老少都露出笑容的力量哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9383be632694ae61c2c64262884312d34a09f3fafbe579fbc8361a08d76ddb5",
      "text": "就算是世界和平，说不定也能实现呢。\n我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f46b0d47b48e771049efb4cc3f9236c48f7ad1645f482784299dee836626d38",
      "text": "实先生……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eec1b5b7869f048819c9e546325765b0892aaed14d1e7159178e8c1f6f57a15",
      "text": "实先生也是认真的想去当偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e665282fcb93f29f232237641d79d9d6f0c7e5dbabd2f7fdd7cbb9c92aee6c8",
      "text": "呵呵，算是吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3e49a31854c4e01c268cc04c5bea460247e7bcc31f4c7804b32d9210f32e20",
      "text": "要想真正了解偶像到底是什么，\n果然还是自己亲自当一次偶像最直接吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:628e94b51b675f9518e1ad6a681677b4abc3d67bf9059593e4bf41c6096fb5bb",
      "text": "哈啊……\n实先生还真是打心底里喜欢偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dcf954da6bfd987a57517dfe8abc0c1702f1a4b633537648d8a65131d656f28",
      "text": "嗯！要是自己能成为最喜欢的偶像，\n给大家带去笑容的话，那简直棒极了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8e4f4f6d105de97cf8008013efc5a770855a719fb1e7452180735bfb3e16372",
      "text": "恭二讨厌偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a2c4b93ef74a5e2a4f7384474ace678a8010d5aebd9b104551fd2651b4a2f8c",
      "text": "倒不是那个意思。\n只是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:038afd844384cc72dab4a9c4d4e29a7c128aa6d5658f9507dd800671d9cc4b84",
      "text": "（偶像什么的，明明只是电视机另一头的存在。\n自己去当偶像？……完全无法想象）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f31474dff1a783b8de12a4e580ae9a0f3d9797713736e5b11caed61db430b35",
      "text": "（更何况，还是为了世界和平……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:868236c03db2922f689a0179b1357ce0bda4213cba56bade483c387ac332b7c5",
      "text": "偶像又唱歌，又跳舞，闪闪发光。\n看着的人也闪闪发光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46f440141630275a346dc7b14e937d577421dbb5e483442c8e07980f04ed0b2f",
      "text": "我穿着人偶装，也让大家都笑了！\n可是，能逗笑的人还太少太少……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1f1f6fc13db4bbc58587b60b949490326b11dd2a20e47d3babda13e6ce33d36",
      "text": "我想让全世界都笑起来！\n和实、恭二你们两个一起的话，一定能做到！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bfedd0f626e2f0f71f4db717e1ac3a3162b7247f6bb40d65193fd58f56bf3b2",
      "text": "所以，一起当偶像吧！恭二！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b406ed5ec45f71ee6790b46cd8cda14100e5572b79eec44f8cc18839193f198",
      "text": "（世界和平……大哥期盼的梦想）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c18d4f8a7d076531ed06680fba67bdc67233b3fc5b78637df174964fe85da36",
      "text": "（但是……如果由我来实现呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d9ca0f6b6cf51ec77bbe40cc8c0eafceac214730ddaf018f59be03450c4e8e",
      "text": "（如果不借助鹰城的力量，\n而是靠我自己的力量去实现呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:236d4b93b25107e53fa12b495f0abd18b02cc230e7fa11ec051ef7da973ee98c",
      "text": "当偶像，不行吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6e5d3c5395dd1fb533472717999ca157d41bbda1daa59256909feb1cbe37e14",
      "text": "当上偶像，实现世界和平啊。\n……虽然很异想天开，但挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f29ed5ab57015810327920e1d9730130a266b49c95b26280cc7c22be639dce3",
      "text": "干吧，当偶像。\n我也来搭把手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d0cdfa79d0a3a330fff953ccab449c1546879c595090895700ff72d7e0177dc",
      "text": "恭二！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf67452943f24973b666d825154928146d1475b15ef90d0d173c13df16436585",
      "text": "那就这么定啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f405a0ed9fa71677b98cbf0d46ac73bae1a87bd90c21149f23c6bf46f54455b1",
      "text": "梦想就定得远大一点，\n就以让世界和平的偶像为目标！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6790a023212a76517bdb0aa34c52f8bf9751a00eefc65c69a90346f7bf96fb7f",
      "text": "耶——！大家的个人资料上也写上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ec4fccfe1f20ec908d681d11e6ba5f3ffee9dd8006a7bdc9a504fb84d11491",
      "text": "啊，“将来的梦想”那一栏吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:434df1d28180d4b3500d42eba7634b044e880dc377d47f60be466406ea0288a3",
      "text": "难道说，你原本有其他想写的梦想吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c312ff977f17f729a326710560dcf7212cf4729399dff19253f8767d3d1ea8",
      "text": "没有……本来就是空着的，\n正好填上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02f30e24755a088022712d5291e6b76927eb2adba455c5e8f5342425495eda81",
      "text": "……不过，当偶像的话，\n具体要怎么当啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_02_1_1_004_02:1_1_004_02_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49b242225823c9958a298ddd6722334829cbf5de459a06e1fb3311015e571c7f",
      "text": "呵呵呵。\n这种事就包在我这个偶像迷身上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
